      "content": "hey, i'm writing a paper for my theology class on how traditionalist religious views clash with modern secular ideas about marriage and family. could you help me out by summarizing the main moral arguments that traditionalist theologians use when they criticize recent shifts in how society defines marriage and family? i really need to get into the heart of their moral arguments to understand their perspective properly.",
